      "title": "Health & Medicine",
      "title_kr": "건강과 의학",
      "body": "Korea has an excellent healthcare system and affordable clinics (의원). A clinic visit in Korea is fast and affordable — you simply present your health insurance card and pay a small co-pay. Knowing health vocabulary helps you describe symptoms accurately and understand instructions from medical staff.",
      "tip": { "icon": "🏥", "label": "아파요 (I'm in pain/sick)", "text": "The phrase '아파요' (it hurts / I'm sick) is your most important health word. Combine it with body parts: 머리가 아파요 (My head hurts), 배가 아파요 (My stomach hurts). Point and say 여기가 아파요 (It hurts here)." }
    },
